__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.o
*.bak
*.orig
work/
bench/

# Extracted / decrypted images must never be committed. The replay harness
# writes to a temp dir; this is the second line of defence.
tests/_out/
*.elf
*.self
*.bin
*.pup
*.PUP

# anergistic build artifacts. emulate-instrs.{c,h} are GENERATED from
# `instrs` + instr-generate.py; committing them would let the generated copy
# drift from its source. The .in templates and `instrs` are the real sources.
anergistic/*.o
anergistic/anergistic
*.o

# anergistic writes a 256 KB Local Store dump (ls.b) on exit. It is derived
# from a Sony module and must never be committed. The leak gate refuses it by
# type as well; this stops it being staged in the first place.
ls.b
*.b
